request.description:
Public. controller: category.controller.ts:getAllCategories. Returns all categories ordered by id ASC.
200 -> { success:true, data:[{id,name,slug}], statusCode:200 }
Also available as /api/v1/categories

Public. category.controller.ts:getCategoryBySlug. Lookup by unique slug (e.g. dresses, bags).
200 -> { success:true, data:{id,name,slug} }
404 if not found.

body.raw:
{
 "name": "Shoes",
 "slug": "shoes"
}
// name required 2-100 chars, trimmed
// slug optional 2-120 chars; if omitted auto-generated from name via slugify() (e.g. "Evening Dresses" -> "evening-dresses")
// slug may contain letters (including Arabic), numbers, hyphens only
// Examples:
// { "name": "Shoes" }
// { "name": "Evening Dresses", "slug": "evening-dresses" }
// { "name": "أحذية" } -> slug auto "أحذية"

{
 "name": "Evening Dresses",
 "slug": "evening-dresses"
}
// At least one of name or slug required
// If only name provided, slug auto-regenerates from new name
// If slug provided explicitly, it is normalized via slugify()
// Examples:
// { "name": "Updated Name" }
// { "slug": "custom-slug" }
// { "name": "New Name", "slug": "custom-slug" }

request.description:
Public. product.controller.ts:getProductById — DETAILS view. Returns ALL images with isMain flags + full relations (unlike list which returns only main). Images sorted by sortOrder, isMain indicates card main (outside). Use for product details page.
200 -> { success:true, data:{id,name,categoryId,price,colors:[{id,nameEn,nameAr,hexCode}], sizes, images:[{id,imageUrl,sortOrder,isMain}], category, mainImageUrl, ...}}
400 if invalid id, 404 if not found.

